      "t": "The chef proudly presents his newly created sushi rolls to Kristina. He hopes his culinary skills will impress her and smooth over their previous conflicts.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Кристина, ты знаешь одну вещь?",
